Rust crates linked into the launcher: launcher/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md lists every crate with its licence.

Prism Launcher (https://prismlauncher.org, GPL-3.0) is NOT part of this repository and is not
redistributed by it. The Portalcraft launcher downloads Prism, at the player's request, on the player's own
machine, from Prism's own GitHub release (pinned by sha256 in launcher/pins.json), and runs it as a separate
program. The same goes for Fabric API (Modrinth), Fabric Loader, Minecraft and Java: fetched from their own
sources on the player's machine, never shipped here.
